--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0a3e05ac99e285f46a346cc951bb5545, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialDatabase
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Tutorial.TutorialDatabase
  Entries:
  - Id: 0
    DisplayType: 0
    Title: Welcome!
    Body: Dig down, get rich. Mine ore and sell it at the Depot for Dollars, spend
      Dollars at the Market on upgrades and automation, and keep an eye out for rare
      Artifacts.
  - Id: 1
    DisplayType: 0
    Title: Storage Depot
    Body: Deposit the ore you're carrying here, then sell it. Ores stored here can
      also be used in the Processing Center to trade time for extra money!
  - Id: 2
    DisplayType: 0
    Title: Market
    Body: Spend money here on upgrades. These upgrades are lost when prestiging.
  - Id: 3
    DisplayType: 0
    Title: Museum
    Body: Spend the Artifacts you've found here on permanent Prestige upgrades that
      carry across resets. Purchases queue up and only take effect once you prestige.
  - Id: 4
    DisplayType: 0
    Title: Processing Center
    Body: Combine raw ore into finished goods worth more than the raw materials.
      Finished goods show up back at the Depot, ready to sell. Utilizes ores stored
      in the Depot.
  - Id: 5
    DisplayType: 0
    Title: Control Center
    Body: 'Refuel/Repair yourself here. Once unlocked: monitor your automatons and
      drones and adjust their settings.'
  - Id: 6
    DisplayType: 2
    Title: Museum
    Body: The Museum is where you spend Artifacts on permanent perks. Purchases
      queue up and only take effect once you prestige, which resets everything
      including money and upgrades - but your next run will be faster!
  - Id: 7
    DisplayType: 2
    Title: Processing Center
    Body: The Processing Center turns raw ore into refined goods you can sell for
      more at the Market.
